#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {name}"
msgstr "Instalēt {name}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Install {title}"
msgstr "Instalēt {title}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"A .deb file can't go on the system. For everything to work, look for {title} as an .rpm file or in Bazaar, the app store.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a box anyway, without those parts."
msgstr ""
"Instalēt {title}\n"
"\n"
"Konteinerā šīs {title} daļas nedarbosies:\n"
"{notes}\n"
".deb failu nevar instalēt sistēmā. Lai viss darbotos, meklējiet {title} kā .rpm failu vai lietotņu veikalā Bazaar.\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: tomēr ievieto to konteinerā, bez šīm daļām."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"It comes from {maker}'s own download source, which is added to the system so {title} keeps updating. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"To connect, you need a {maker} account."
msgstr ""
"Instalēt {title}\n"
"\n"
"Tā nāk no {maker} lejupielādes avota, kas tiek pievienots sistēmai, lai {title} turpinātu atjaunināties. Nepieciešama jūsu parole un pārstartēšana.\n"
"\n"
"Lai izveidotu savienojumu, jums ir nepieciešams {maker} konts."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Add to the system. In a box, these parts of {title} won't work:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"On the system, everything works. Needs your password and a restart.\n"
"\n"
"Or {setup}: puts it in a separate box. It's easier to remove, but those parts won't work."
msgstr ""
"Instalēt {title}\n"
"\n"
"Ieteicams: Pievienot sistēmai. Konteinerā šīs {title} daļas nedarbosies:\n"
"{notes}\n"
"Sistēmā viss darbojas. Nepieciešama jūsu parole un pārstartēšana.\n"
"\n"
"Vai arī {setup}: ievieto to atsevišķā konteinerā. To ir vieglāk noņemt, bet šīs daļas nedarbosies."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Install {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: puts it in a separate box. Your system isn't changed, and Remove Apps takes it out cleanly."
msgstr ""
"Instalēt {title}\n"
"\n"
"{setup}: ievieto to atsevišķā konteinerā. Jūsu sistēma netiek mainīta, un “Noņemt lietotnes” to izņem pilnībā."

