msgid ""
"It gives anyone at the keyboard a shell with full control, with no password."
msgstr ""
"Tas ikvienam pie tastatūras nodrošina čaulu ar pilnīgu kontroli bez paroles."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "It goes in the {label} and updates with System Update."
msgstr ""
"Tā tiek ievietota šeit: {label}. Tā tiek atjaunināta ar rīku “Sistēmas "
"atjaunināšana”."

msgid "It has no app of its own; other apps in the box use it."
msgstr "Tam nav savas lietotnes; to izmanto citas konteinera lietotnes."

msgid "It has no window of its own in Show Apps."
msgstr "Tam nav sava loga sadaļā “Rādīt lietotnes”."

msgid "It is a command-line tool, so it has no window in Show Apps."
msgstr ""
"Tas ir komandrindas rīks, tāpēc tam nav sava loga sadaļā “Rādīt lietotnes”."

msgid "It is made for a different kind of processor than this computer has."
msgstr "Tas ir paredzēts cita veida procesoram, nevis tam, kas ir šajā datorā."

msgid ""
"It may not work yet. When it does, it works in Firefox and the Camera app, "
"not every app."
msgstr ""
"Iespējams, tā vēl nedarbojas. Kad darbosies, tā darbosies pārlūkprogrammā "
"Firefox un lietotnē Kamera, bet ne visās lietotnēs."

msgid ""
"It needs parts that the Ubuntu box (Ubuntu 24.04) does not have. It may be "
