msgid "Take a screenshot or record the screen"
msgstr "Uzņemt ekrānattēlu vai ierakstīt ekrānu"

msgid "Take it out"
msgstr "Izņemt"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Take out {setting}"
msgstr "Izņemt {setting}"

msgid "Take the extra formats out again"
msgstr "Vēlreiz izņemt papildu formātus"

msgid "Task Manager: Resources. Find it in the start menu."
msgstr "Uzdevumu pārvaldnieks: Resursi. To var atrast sākuma izvēlnē."

msgid "Teal to start. Folder icons follow whatever color you pick."
msgstr "Sākumā zilganzaļa. Mapju ikonas seko jebkurai krāsai, ko izvēlaties."

msgid "Test automatic rollback"
msgstr "Pārbaudīt automātisko atgriešanu"

msgid "Text size"
msgstr "Teksta lielums"

msgid "That couldn't be saved."
msgstr "To neizdevās saglabāt."

msgid "That didn't save. Try again in Wheelhouse, Network safety."
msgstr ""
"Tas netika saglabāts. Mēģiniet vēlreiz programmā Wheelhouse sadaļā “Tīkla "
"drošība”."

msgid "That folder belongs to someone else."
msgstr "Šī mape pieder kādam citam."

msgid "That folder has no pictures in it (JPEG, PNG or WebP)."
msgstr "Šajā mapē nav neviena attēla (JPEG, PNG vai WebP)."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "That folder is already shared, as {name}."
msgstr "Šī mape jau ir koplietota ar nosaukumu {name}."

msgid "That folder isn't shared."
msgstr "Šī mape nav koplietota."

msgid "That folder wasn't found."
msgstr "Šī mape netika atrasta."

msgid "That folder's name can't be shared. Rename it or pick another."
msgstr ""
"Šīs mapes nosaukumu nevar izmantot koplietošanai. Pārdēvējiet to vai "
"izvēlieties citu."

msgid "That isn't let in here."
msgstr "Tas šeit nav atļauts."

msgid "That isn't the disk password, so nothing was changed. Try again."
msgstr "Tā nav diska parole, tāpēc nekas netika mainīts. Mēģiniet vēlreiz."

msgid ""
"That was the wrong disk password too many times, so it's locked for an hour. "
"Nothing was changed. Try again after that."
msgstr ""
"Pārāk daudz reižu tika ievadīta nepareiza diska parole, tāpēc tā ir bloķēta "
"uz stundu. Nekas netika mainīts. Pēc tam mēģiniet vēlreiz."

msgid ""
"The BIOS screen uses the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or"
" Exit."
msgstr ""
"BIOS ekrānā izmanto tastatūru. Kad esat pabeiguši, izvēlieties Save and Exit "
"vai Exit."

msgid ""
"The BIOS's RAID setting (Intel RST) hides the disk. Restart into the BIOS and"
" set the storage mode (often called SATA mode or SATA operation) to AHCI. "
"Windows on this disk won't start after that change, but installing EvenKeelOS"
" erases it anyway."
msgstr ""
"BIOS RAID iestatījums (Intel RST) paslēpj disku. Pārstartējiet BIOS "
"iestatījumos un iestatiet krātuves režīmu (bieži saukts SATA mode vai SATA "
"operation) uz AHCI. Pēc šīs izmaiņas Windows šajā diskā vairs nestartēsies, "
"taču EvenKeelOS instalēšana to tik un tā izdzēš."

msgid "The Bluetooth driver is blocked, so there's no Bluetooth."
msgstr "Bluetooth draiveris ir bloķēts, tāpēc Bluetooth nav pieejams."

msgid ""
"The NVIDIA card runs on the open-source driver built into EvenKeelOS. The "
"proprietary NVIDIA driver isn't used: it breaks too often to keep the promise"
" that EvenKeelOS just works. If you need it, use Bazzite or Bluefin's NVIDIA "
"editions instead."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA karte darbojas ar EvenKeelOS iebūvēto atvērtā pirmkoda draiveri. "
"Patentētais NVIDIA draiveris netiek izmantots: tas pārāk bieži salūzt, lai "
"varētu turēt solījumu, ka EvenKeelOS vienkārši darbojas. Ja jums tas ir "
"vajadzīgs, tā vietā izmantojiet Bazzite vai Bluefin NVIDIA versijas."

msgid "The QR code could not be made. Save the log to a stick instead."
msgstr "QR kodu neizdevās izveidot. Tā vietā saglabājiet žurnālu zibatmiņā."

msgid "The USB stick could not be opened."
msgstr "USB zibatmiņu neizdevās atvērt."

msgid "The VPN list is missing."
msgstr "Trūkst VPN saraksta."

msgid "The Wi-Fi card's driver is blocked, so there's no Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Wi-Fi kartes draiveris ir bloķēts, tāpēc Wi-Fi nav pieejams."

msgid "The administrator password was not given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr "Administratora parole netika norādīta, tāpēc nekas netika mainīts."

msgid "The administrator password wasn't given, so nothing was changed."
msgstr "Administratora parole netika norādīta, tāpēc nekas netika mainīts."

msgid "The app system (Flatpak)"
msgstr "Lietotņu sistēma (Flatpak)"

msgid "The app's instructions say TCP, UDP or both"
msgstr "Lietotnes norādījumos minēts TCP, UDP vai abi"

msgid "The automatic rollback test worked."
msgstr "Automātiskās atgriešanas tests izdevās."

msgid ""
"The automatic update is already running, so this window follows it until it's"
" done. You can keep working."
msgstr ""
"Automātiskā atjaunināšana jau notiek, tāpēc šis logs seko tai līdz beigām. "
"Varat turpināt strādāt."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%% and the computer isn't plugged in. If the battery runs"
" out during the update, the update is lost and has to start "
"again.\\n\\nRecommended: Not now. Plug the computer in, then start System "
"Update again.\\n\\nOr Update anyway."
msgstr ""
"Akumulatora uzlādes līmenis ir %s%%, un dators nav pievienots elektrotīklam. "
"Ja atjaunināšanas laikā akumulators izlādējas, atjauninājums tiek zaudēts un "
"jāsāk no jauna.\\n\\nIeteicams: Ne tagad. Pievienojiet datoru elektrotīklam "
"un pēc tam vēlreiz palaidiet rīku “Sistēmas atjaunināšana”.\\n\\nVai arī "
"Tomēr atjaunināt."

msgid ""
"The battery is at %s%%. Plug the computer in: if it runs out during the "
"update, the update is lost."
msgstr ""
"Akumulatora uzlādes līmenis ir %s%%. Pievienojiet datoru elektrotīklam: ja "
"atjaunināšanas laikā akumulators izlādēsies, atjauninājums tiks zaudēts."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The biggest disk holds {gb} GB."
msgstr "Lielākā diska ietilpība ir {gb} GB."

msgid "The boot entry is already named %s. Nothing to do."
msgstr "Sāknēšanas ierakstam jau ir nosaukums %s. Nav nekā darāma."

msgid "The boot options can't be read right now"
msgstr "Pašlaik nevar nolasīt sāknēšanas opcijas"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The boot options didn't change: {reason}"
msgstr "Sāknēšanas opcijas netika mainītas: {reason}"

msgid "The boot options the computer starts with couldn't be read."
msgstr "Neizdevās nolasīt sāknēšanas opcijas, ar kurām dators tiek startēts."

msgid "The box is missing or broken."
msgstr "Konteinera nav vai tas ir bojāts."

msgid ""
"The buttons at a window's top right minimize, maximize and close it, as on "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"Pogas loga augšējā labajā stūrī ļauj logu minimizēt, maksimizēt un aizvērt, "
"tāpat kā operētājsistēmā Windows."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The camera ({device})"
msgstr "Kamera ({device})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The certificate \"{name}\" was added to this computer and has been removed, "
"so it's no longer trusted. If you didn't remove it, tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"Sertifikāts “{name}” tika pievienots šim datoram un ir noņemts, tāpēc tas "
"vairs netiek uzskatīts par uzticamu. Ja jūs to nenoņēmāt, pastāstiet par to "
"savam palīgam."

msgid "The certificates couldn't be checked."
msgstr "Sertifikātus neizdevās pārbaudīt."

msgid "The change was not made, and nothing was left behind."
msgstr "Izmaiņas netika veiktas, un nekas nepalika pāri."

msgid "The check couldn't finish."
msgstr "Pārbaudi neizdevās pabeigt."

msgid "The clock and time zone settings could not be saved."
msgstr "Pulksteņa un laika joslas iestatījumus neizdevās saglabāt."

msgid ""
"The codecs are installed. They start working after a restart, which the setup"
" checklist offers at its end."
msgstr ""
"Kodeki ir instalēti. Tie sāk darboties pēc pārstartēšanas, ko iestatīšanas "
"kontrolsaraksts piedāvā beigās."

msgid ""
"The codecs are installed.\\n\\nRecommended: Restart now to start using them. "
"Or Later."
msgstr ""
"Kodeki ir instalēti.\\n\\nIeteicams: Pārstartēt tūlīt, lai sāktu tos lietot. "
"Vai arī Vēlāk."

msgid "The codecs are removed. Restart to finish."
msgstr "Kodeki ir noņemti. Lai pabeigtu, pārstartējiet datoru."

msgid "The codecs weren't removed."
msgstr "Kodeki netika noņemti."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The computer didn't start properly with the boot options changed in "
"Wheelhouse, so it went back to the version from {since}, with the boot "
"options it had before."
msgstr ""
"Dators nestartējās pareizi ar programmā Wheelhouse mainītajām sāknēšanas "
"opcijām, tāpēc tas atgriezās pie versijas no {since} ar iepriekšējām "
"sāknēšanas opcijām."

msgid ""
"The computer hasn't saved a copy of its settings since this start yet. Wait a"
" few minutes and try again. If it keeps saying this, tell your helper: the "
"copy isn't being saved."
msgstr ""
"Kopš šīs startēšanas dators vēl nav saglabājis savu iestatījumu kopiju. "
"Uzgaidiet dažas minūtes un mēģiniet vēlreiz. Ja šis ziņojums atkārtojas, "
"pastāstiet savam palīgam, ka kopija netiek saglabāta."

msgid "The computer locks up"
msgstr "Dators sastingst"

msgid ""
"The computer may not start, or may lose its drive, memory or processors."
msgstr "Dators var nestartēties vai zaudēt disku, atmiņu vai procesorus."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts and opens its BIOS settings screen. Save your work first.\n"
"\n"
"The BIOS settings are used with the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or Exit, to start the computer again."
msgstr ""
"Dators pārstartējas un atver BIOS iestatījumu ekrānu. Vispirms saglabājiet darbu.\n"
"\n"
"BIOS iestatījumos izmanto tastatūru. Kad esat pabeiguši, izvēlieties Save and Exit vai Exit, lai dators startētos no jauna."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts, fails on purpose, then goes back by itself. A note at "
"login says the test worked and what the test copy found broken."
msgstr ""
"Dators pārstartējas, tīši izraisa kļūmi un pēc tam pats atgriežas. Piezīme "
"ierakstoties paziņo, ka tests izdevās, un ko testa kopija atklāja kā bojātu."

msgid "The computer starts with the usual settings."
msgstr "Dators startējas ar parastajiem iestatījumiem."

msgid ""
"The computer would start without the desktop: a text screen or a rescue "
"shell."
msgstr "Dators startētos bez darbvirsmas: teksta ekrānā vai glābšanas čaulā."

msgid "The desktop"
msgstr "Darbvirsma"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The device rule wasn't added, so the device may not work.\n"
"\n"
"{details}"
msgstr ""
"Ierīces noteikums netika pievienots, tāpēc ierīce, iespējams, nedarbosies.\n"
"\n"
"{details}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The device rule wasn't added, so the device may not work.\n"
"{details}"
msgstr ""
"Ierīces noteikums netika pievienots, tāpēc ierīce, iespējams, nedarbosies.\n"
"{details}"

