#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put every tool in one System Tools window"
msgstr "Ievietot visus rīkus vienā “Sistēmas rīki” logā"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Leave nothing behind when a VPN is removed"
msgstr "Neatstāt neko aiz sevis, kad VPN tiek noņemts"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Get a VPN, with VPNs that keep updating"
msgstr "Pievienot “Iegūt VPN” ar VPN, kas turpina atjaunināties"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Give Zoom meetings their own guide"
msgstr "Dot Zoom sapulcēm savu ceļvedi"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Open Zoom meetings in Chrome, in Zoom's web version"
msgstr "Atvērt Zoom sapulces pārlūkā Chrome, Zoom tīmekļa versijā"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Stop ArtCraft installs from breaking Flathub installs"
msgstr "Novērst, ka ArtCraft instalēšana sabojā Flathub instalēšanu"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Recognize installers by their usual file name"
msgstr "Atpazīt instalētājus pēc to parastā faila nosaukuma"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Linux replacements for Windows programs"
msgstr "Piedāvāt Linux aizstājējus Windows programmām"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix box setup: distrobox mounts read-only folders wrong"
msgstr "Labot konteinera iestatīšanu: distrobox nepareizi pievieno tikai lasāmas mapes"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer Fedora or Ubuntu versions of Windows programs"
msgstr "Piedāvāt Windows programmu Fedora vai Ubuntu versijas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Offer the Linux version when a Windows program is opened"
msgstr "Piedāvāt Linux versiju, kad tiek atvērta Windows programma"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Ship one shim, so firmware adds no extra Fedora entry"
msgstr "Piegādāt vienu shim, lai aparātprogrammatūra nepievienotu papildu Fedora ierakstu"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Put Fedora's firewall zone back"
msgstr "Atjaunot Fedora ugunsmūra zonu"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Harden root helpers, firewall and no-password updates"
msgstr "Pastiprināt root palīgus, ugunsmūri un atjauninājumus bez paroles"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New defaults: wallpapers, accent folders, lock screen"
msgstr "Jauni noklusējumi: fona attēli, akcenta mapes, bloķēšanas ekrāns"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "New default: teal accent color, also on the login screen"
msgstr "Jauns noklusējums: zilganzaļa akcenta krāsa, arī ierakstīšanās ekrānā"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix rollback note, login-loop and stuck tests"
msgstr "Labot atgriešanas piezīmi, ierakstīšanās cilpu un iestrēgušos testus"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix freeze rollback and cut retries to 2"
msgstr "Labot atgriešanu pēc sastingšanas un samazināt mēģinājumus līdz 2"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix the automatic rollback tests"
msgstr "Labot automātiskās atgriešanas testus"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Real failure tests for automatic rollback"
msgstr "Reāli kļūmju testi automātiskajai atgriešanai"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add automatic rollback with greenboot"
msgstr "Pievienot automātisko atgriešanu ar greenboot"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Start the Windows layout on the desktop, plus small fixes"
msgstr "Palaist Windows izkārtojumu darbvirsmā, kā arī nelieli labojumi"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Pause automatic updates for 3 days after an undo"
msgstr "Apturēt automātiskos atjauninājumus uz 3 dienām pēc atsaukšanas"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add a Desktop layout step to the installer"
msgstr "Pievienot instalētājam darbvirsmas izkārtojuma soli"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add Desktop layout to System Tools"
msgstr "Pievienot “Darbvirsmas izkārtojums” sadaļai “Sistēmas rīki”"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Keep power-mode switches from waiting on updates"
msgstr "Novērst, ka jaudas režīmu pārslēgšana gaida atjauninājumus"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Add an optional Windows-style layout"
msgstr "Pievienot izvēles Windows stila izkārtojumu"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Fix Fedora 45 presets and container policy paths"
msgstr "Labot Fedora 45 iepriekšiestatījumus un konteineru politikas ceļus"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Read download sources in Fedora 45's new folder"
msgstr "Lasīt lejupielādes avotus jaunajā Fedora 45 mapē"

#. Translators: a change in an update, listed under What is new
msgid "Move to Fedora 45"
msgstr "Pāriet uz Fedora 45"

msgid "Fonts and text size are back to EvenKeelOS's own."
msgstr "Fonti un teksta lielums ir atgriezti EvenKeelOS sākotnējos iestatījumos."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Recommended: Delete the box. It comes back by itself the next time you install {apps}. Anything added to the box another way is deleted too. Your files are not touched."
msgstr "Ieteicams: Dzēst konteineru. Tas pats atgriezīsies nākamreiz, kad instalēsiet {apps}. Arī viss, kas konteineram pievienots citā veidā, tiek izdzēsts. Jūsu faili netiek skarti."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Deleting it frees about {size}."
msgstr "Dzēšana atbrīvo aptuveni {size}."

msgid "Asks once whether a password Wi-Fi network is Home, Work or a Public place"
msgstr "Vienreiz pajautā, vai ar paroli aizsargāts Wi-Fi tīkls ir “Mājas”, “Darbs” vai “Publiska vieta”"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "EvenKeelOS needs at least {gb} GB."
msgstr "EvenKeelOS ir nepieciešami vismaz {gb} GB."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "EvenKeelOS works best with {gb} GB or more, so it may be slow."
msgstr "EvenKeelOS vislabāk darbojas ar {gb} GB vai vairāk, tāpēc tas var darboties lēni."

msgid "organizing and developing photos"
msgstr "fotoattēlu kārtošana un apstrāde"

